{"seq":1,"slug":"crossborder-data-flow-map","title":"跨境数据流图与字段清单","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-data-transfer-compliance/outbound-data-inventory/crossborder-data-flow-map","wordCount":2184,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"跨境数据流图与字段清单\">跨境数据流图与字段清单</h1><p>合规团队最常见的工作方式是发问卷：给每个业务团队发一份表格，让他们手填「你的系统有没有把数据发到境外」。这种方式得到的结果通常有两个特征——<strong>遗漏</strong>与<strong>过期</strong>。遗漏是因为填写者只知道直接的采购关系，不知道自己的服务依赖的下游 SDK 会把数据转发到第三国；过期是因为订正一次要再发一轮问卷。而跨境数据流图要解决的正是这两个问题：它不靠问，靠<strong>推导</strong>；不靠快照，靠<strong>持续对账</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从调用链推导出境路径\">核心概念：从调用链推导出境路径</h2><p>这里的「传送」与「可访问」是两个不同的动作，而法条对两者一视同仁：GDPR 第 44 条约束的是「任何正在被处理、或传输后拟被处理的个人数据」向第三国的传输（<a href=\"https://gdpr-info.eu/art-44-gdpr/\">Article 44 GDPR</a>）；英国 ICO 的表述更直白，一个受限传输发生在组织<strong>发送</strong>或<strong>使个人数据可被访问</strong>给英国以外的独立法律实体时，且无论发起方是控制者、处理者还是次级处理者，合规责任都由发起方承担（<a href=\"https://ico.org.uk/for-organisations/uk-gdpr-guidance-and-resources/international-transfers/international-transfers-a-guide/\">ICO: International transfers</a>）。这意味着一条「境外服务读取境内数据库」的链路与一条「境内服务推送至境外端点」的链路，在数据流图上必须被同等记录——只监控出站推送会系统性漏掉远程读取这一类，而远程读取在微服务和海外 SaaS 场景下恰恰是主流。</p>\n<p>一条数据出境路径在技术上总是表现为某个进程把某些字节发给了另一个司法辖区内的端点。因此数据流图的构造起点是<strong>服务拓扑与出站连接</strong>，而不是业务描述。可推导性来自一个事实：任何跨境的网络出口都必须经过可观测的连接点——出网网关、服务网格的 egress、或云厂商的流量日志。把这些连接按「源服务 → 目标地址 → 目标 ASN/国家」聚合，就得到一张<strong>候选出境边</strong>的清单。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  S[服务拓扑与调用链] --&gt; E1[出网连接日志&lt;br/&gt;source service → dest ip]&#10;  E1 --&gt; G[地理归属标注&lt;br/&gt;dest ip → ASN → 国家]&#10;  G --&gt; C[候选出境边]&#10;  C --&gt; M1[与已知采购清单对齐]&#10;  C --&gt; M2[未匹配: 影子出境]&#10;  M1 --&gt; F[字段级展开]&#10;  M2 --&gt; INV[调查队列]&#10;  F --&gt; R[出境数据清单]\">graph TD\n  S[服务拓扑与调用链] --&gt; E1[出网连接日志&lt;br/&gt;source service → dest ip]\n  E1 --&gt; G[地理归属标注&lt;br/&gt;dest ip → ASN → 国家]\n  G --&gt; C[候选出境边]\n  C --&gt; M1[与已知采购清单对齐]\n  C --&gt; M2[未匹配: 影子出境]\n  M1 --&gt; F[字段级展开]\n  M2 --&gt; INV[调查队列]\n  F --&gt; R[出境数据清单]</pre><h3 id=\"从边到字段的展开\">从边到字段的展开</h3><p>推导的产物是「边」，而清单需要的是「字段」。从边到字段需要一次展开：对每条出境边，找出该调用实际承载的报文结构。这在有 schema 的 RPC 体系里是直接的（从 protobuf/OpenAPI 定义取字段）；在无 schema 的场景（数据库同步、日志投递、对象存储复制）里则需要按表结构或日志模板推断。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  A[出境边: order-service → risk-api.sg] --&gt; B[报文 schema]&#10;  B --&gt; C1[字段: user_id]&#10;  B --&gt; C2[字段: device_fingerprint]&#10;  B --&gt; C3[字段: shipping_address]&#10;  B --&gt; C4[字段: order_amount]&#10;  C1 --&gt; D[分类: 个人数据]&#10;  C2 --&gt; D&#10;  C3 --&gt; D2[分类: 敏感个人数据?]&#10;  C4 --&gt; D3[分类: 非个人数据]\">graph LR\n  A[出境边: order-service → risk-api.sg] --&gt; B[报文 schema]\n  B --&gt; C1[字段: user_id]\n  B --&gt; C2[字段: device_fingerprint]\n  B --&gt; C3[字段: shipping_address]\n  B --&gt; C4[字段: order_amount]\n  C1 --&gt; D[分类: 个人数据]\n  C2 --&gt; D\n  C3 --&gt; D2[分类: 敏感个人数据?]\n  C4 --&gt; D3[分类: 非个人数据]</pre><h3 id=\"清单的原子单位\">清单的原子单位</h3><p>关键工程判断是：<strong>清单的原子单位是「链路 × 字段」，不是链路也不是字段</strong>。同一个字段在不同的链路上可能承受不同的分类——<code>shipping_address</code> 作为履约数据发给物流商与作为画像特征发给推荐服务，其接收方角色与必要性完全不同。把清单做成表级会丢失这个区分，导致后续机制选择无法按链路差异化。</p>\n<h3 id=\"出网连接的地理归属要打两层标签\">出网连接的地理归属要打两层标签</h3><p>一个容易低估的实现细节是 IP 归属地的判定。单纯用 GeoIP 数据库会出错，因为云厂商的 IP 段常常注册在总部所在国而实际部署在别的区域。稳妥做法是打两层标签：一层是 IP 的注册国（WHOIS/MaxMind），一层是目标端点的<strong>实际服务区域</strong>（由云厂商的区域 API 或端点命名规则推断）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE egress_endpoint (&#10;  endpoint_id     BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  host_pattern    TEXT NOT NULL,          -- 例如 %.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com&#10;  asn             INTEGER,&#10;  geo_registered  CHAR(2),                -- 注册地&#10;  geo_deployed    CHAR(2),                -- 实际部署区域&#10;  is_cross_border BOOLEAN GENERATED ALWAYS AS (&#10;                    geo_deployed IS DISTINCT FROM $exporter_cc) STORED,&#10;  evidence_source TEXT NOT NULL,          -- megaip | cloud_region_api | vendor_doc&#10;  last_seen_at    TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> egress_endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  endpoint_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  host_pattern    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 例如 %.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  asn             </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  geo_registered  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),                </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 注册地</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  geo_deployed    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),                </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 实际部署区域</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  is_cross_border </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> GENERATED</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ALWAYS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    geo_deployed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $exporter_cc) STORED,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  evidence_source </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- megaip | cloud_region_api | vendor_doc</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  last_seen_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>evidence_source</code> 这一列是给审计用的：当监管追问「你怎么知道这批数据发到了德国」时，答案不是「IP 库这么说的」，而是具体的证据来源。两层标签还能直接暴露一类常见误判——注册地在爱尔兰、实际部署在新加坡的端点，如果只看注册地会被判为非出境，实际是出境。</p>\n<h2 id=\"字段级清单的结构\">字段级清单的结构</h2><h3 id=\"三层信息为什么要分层\">三层信息为什么要分层</h3><p>清单需要同时承载三类信息：它是什么（分类）、为什么可以出去（机制）、谁在负责（责任人）。这三类信息的生命周期不同——分类由字段本身决定（稳定），机制由目的地与阈值决定（易变），责任人由组织决定（易变）。把它们放在同一张表里会导致分类被频繁误改，因此应当分层。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 层一: 字段身份与分类(稳定, 由数据字典产生)&#10;CREATE TABLE field_catalog (&#10;  field_uid      TEXT PRIMARY KEY,        -- service.table.column&#10;  semantic_name  TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  data_category  TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (data_category IN&#10;                   (&#39;non_personal&#39;,&#39;personal&#39;,&#39;sensitive_personal&#39;,&#39;important&#39;)),&#10;  subject_scope  TEXT,                    -- customer | employee | merchant | none&#10;  aggregation_risk TEXT                   -- null | &#39;may_become_important&#39;&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 层二: 链路 × 字段(出境事实, 随业务变更)&#10;CREATE TABLE outbound_field_binding (&#10;  binding_id     BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  data_path      TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  field_uid      TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES field_catalog(field_uid),&#10;  endpoint_id    BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES egress_endpoint(endpoint_id),&#10;  importer_entity TEXT NOT NULL,          -- 接收方实体, 决定充分性判定粒度&#10;  importer_role  TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (importer_role IN&#10;                   (&#39;controller&#39;,&#39;processor&#39;,&#39;joint&#39;,&#39;sub_processor&#39;)),&#10;  business_purpose TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  necessity_note TEXT NOT NULL,           -- 为什么这个字段是必需的&#10;  UNIQUE (data_path, field_uid, endpoint_id)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 层一: 字段身份与分类(稳定, 由数据字典产生)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> field_catalog</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  field_uid      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- service.table.column</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  semantic_name  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  data_category  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (data_category </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                   (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'non_personal'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'personal'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'sensitive_personal'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'important'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  subject_scope  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,                    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- customer | employee | merchant | none</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  aggregation_risk </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                   -- null | 'may_become_important'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 层二: 链路 × 字段(出境事实, 随业务变更)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> outbound_field_binding</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  binding_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  data_path      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  field_uid      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> field_catalog(field_uid),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  endpoint_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> egress_endpoint(endpoint_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  importer_entity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 接收方实体, 决定充分性判定粒度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  importer_role  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (importer_role </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                   (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'controller'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'processor'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'joint'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'sub_processor'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  business_purpose </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  necessity_note </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,           </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 为什么这个字段是必需的</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (data_path, field_uid, endpoint_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>importer_role</code> 是这张表里最有价值的一列。它直接决定第一章里的 SCC 模块选择（模块二对应处理者、模块一对应控制者），也决定第三章 TIA 的评估模板。把它作为清单的必填字段，可以避免「合同按处理者签、业务按控制者用」这类错配。</p>\n<p><code>necessity_note</code> 看似是文档性字段，实际是<a href=\"data-localization-minimize\">本地化优先与最小出境</a> 的输入：一个字段如果写不出具体的必要性理由，它就是最小化审查的第一个候选。把它设成 <code>NOT NULL</code> 而不是可选，是为了让「说不出理由」在写入时就被暴露，而不是在评审会上靠人追问。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自动对账-让清单不会过期\">自动对账：让清单不会过期</h2><p>清单一旦静态化就必然过期。让它不过期的办法不是提高填写频率，而是建立<strong>自动对账</strong>：把推导出的候选出境边与已登记清单比对，两侧的差集各代表一类问题。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>差集方向</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>处置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>推导有、清单无</td>\n<td>影子出境（未登记的传输）</td>\n<td>阻断该边并进入调查队列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>清单有、推导无</td>\n<td>已下线链路未清理</td>\n<td>标记待废弃，复核后归档</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字段级不一致</td>\n<td>报文新增字段未登记</td>\n<td>新字段先入候选分类队列</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第一类是最高优先级：影子出境意味着一次没有机制支撑的传输正在发生。工程上它必须能触发实际的阻断，而不是只发告警——否则清单会退化成一份漂亮的报表。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 对账视图: 推导出的边与已登记清单的双向差集&#10;WITH derived AS (&#10;  SELECT DISTINCT e.gress_hash, e.service, e.endpoint_id&#10;  FROM egress_observation e&#10;  WHERE e.geo_deployed IS DISTINCT FROM e.exporter_cc&#10;    AND e.observed_at &gt; now() - INTERVAL &#39;30 days&#39;&#10;),&#10;registered AS (&#10;  SELECT DISTINCT b.data_path, b.endpoint_id&#10;  FROM outbound_field_binding b&#10;)&#10;SELECT COALESCE(d.service, r.data_path) AS subject,&#10;       d.endpoint_id,&#10;       CASE WHEN r.data_path IS NULL THEN &#39;shadow_egress&#39;&#10;            WHEN d.service IS NULL THEN &#39;stale_entry&#39;&#10;       END AS defect&#10;FROM derived d&#10;FULL OUTER JOIN registered r&#10;  ON r.data_path = d.service AND r.endpoint_id = d.endpoint_id&#10;WHERE d.service IS NULL OR r.data_path IS NULL;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 对账视图: 推导出的边与已登记清单的双向差集</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> derived </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">gress_hash</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">service</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">endpoint_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> egress_observation e</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">geo_deployed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">exporter_cc</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">observed_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'30 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">registered </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">data_path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">endpoint_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> outbound_field_binding b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">service</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">data_path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> subject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">endpoint_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">data_path</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'shadow_egress'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">service</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'stale_entry'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> defect</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> derived d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FULL OUTER JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> registered r</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">data_path</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">service</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">endpoint_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">endpoint_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">service</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> OR</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">data_path</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>对账周期应当与日志保留期匹配：30 天窗口覆盖绝大多数周期性调用，同时避免被历史流量长期噪声干扰。对于季节性业务（大促期间新增链路），需要在业务日历上单独标注，否则大促结束后的「过期条目」告警会变成误报噪音。</p>\n<h2 id=\"清单如何驱动闸门\">清单如何驱动闸门</h2><p>清单的最终价值不在被阅读，而在被<strong>执行</strong>。可执行的清单需要满足三个条件：字段级（能精确到报文里的具体键）、有分类（分类能映射到机制）、有接收方标识（能决定机制参数）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"check_egress(request):&#10;  path   = request.data_path&#10;  fields = extract_fields(request.payload, request.schema_ref)&#10;  for f in fields:&#10;     b = lookup_binding(path, f.uid, request.endpoint)&#10;     if b is null:&#10;        return BLOCK(&quot;unregistered_field&quot;, field=f.uid)   # 影子字段&#10;     if b.importer_entity != request.importer_entity:&#10;        return BLOCK(&quot;importer_mismatch&quot;)                 # 接收方漂移&#10;  decision = mechanism_matrix.decide(path, fields, request.importer_cc)&#10;  if not decision.prerequisites_satisfied:&#10;     return BLOCK(&quot;mechanism_prereq_missing&quot;, need=decision.missing)&#10;  return ALLOW(decision.binding_mechanism, evidence_level=decision.evidence_level)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>check_egress(request):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  path   = request.data_path</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  fields = extract_fields(request.payload, request.schema_ref)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for f in fields:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     b = lookup_binding(path, f.uid, request.endpoint)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     if b is null:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return BLOCK(\"unregistered_field\", field=f.uid)   # 影子字段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     if b.importer_entity != request.importer_entity:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return BLOCK(\"importer_mismatch\")                 # 接收方漂移</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  decision = mechanism_matrix.decide(path, fields, request.importer_cc)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if not decision.prerequisites_satisfied:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     return BLOCK(\"mechanism_prereq_missing\", need=decision.missing)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return ALLOW(decision.binding_mechanism, evidence_level=decision.evidence_level)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这段闸门逻辑里两个 <code>BLOCK</code> 分支值得强调。<code>unregistered_field</code> 处理的是<strong>报文漂移</strong>：上游在迭代中往同一个接口加了一个新字段，字段本身可能无关紧要，但它未经分类就跨境了——这正是「先出境、后登记」的典型失序。<code>importer_mismatch</code> 处理的是<strong>接收方漂移</strong>：链路没变，但接收主体从子公司换成了母公司或换到了另一个法域，机制参数随之失效。两类漂移都不是通过人工评审能稳定发现的，必须由闸门在执行时拦住。</p>\n<p>闸门输出的 <code>decision</code> 会被写成一条事件记录，记录里保留的是字段<strong>身份</strong>而不是字段值——这套留痕结构见 <a href=\"../transfer-enforce-audit/outbound-request-log-attest\">出境请求留痕与证据留存</a>。把「登记了什么」与「实际发了什么」在同一个事件里对齐，是清单能够被审计的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>数据流图的构造起点是<strong>服务拓扑与出网连接</strong>，靠推导而非问卷；推导产物是边，清单需要的是「链路 × 字段」。</li>\n<li>出网端点要打<strong>两层地理标签</strong>（注册地与实践部署区域），并保留证据来源，否则会出现「注册在爱尔兰、部署在新加坡」的误判。</li>\n<li>清单分两层：<strong>字段身份与分类</strong>稳定、<strong>链路绑定</strong>易变；分离后分类不会被频繁误改。</li>\n<li><code>importer_role</code> 是清单里最关键的一列，它决定 SCC 模块与 TIA 模板；<code>necessity_note</code> 设为必填可让最小化审查自动获得候选。</li>\n<li>让清单不过期的手段是<strong>自动对账</strong>，双向差集分别对应影子出境与过期条目；影子出境必须能真正阻断。</li>\n<li>闸门要拦住两类漂移：<strong>报文新增字段</strong>与<strong>接收方主体变更</strong>。</li>\n<li>下一篇 <a href=\"sensitive-data-transfer-scope\">敏感/个人数据出境范围识别</a> 展开清单里 <code>data_category</code> 这一列的判定方法。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"跨境数据流图与字段清单","id":"跨境数据流图与字段清单"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从调用链推导出境路径","id":"核心概念-从调用链推导出境路径"},{"level":3,"text":"从边到字段的展开","id":"从边到字段的展开"},{"level":3,"text":"清单的原子单位","id":"清单的原子单位"},{"level":3,"text":"出网连接的地理归属要打两层标签","id":"出网连接的地理归属要打两层标签"},{"level":2,"text":"字段级清单的结构","id":"字段级清单的结构"},{"level":3,"text":"三层信息为什么要分层","id":"三层信息为什么要分层"},{"level":2,"text":"自动对账：让清单不会过期","id":"自动对账-让清单不会过期"},{"level":2,"text":"清单如何驱动闸门","id":"清单如何驱动闸门"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多法域传输机制矩阵配置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-data-transfer-compliance/transfer-mechanism-config/multi-region-transfer-rule"},"next":{"title":"敏感/个人数据出境范围识别","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-data-transfer-compliance/outbound-data-inventory/sensitive-data-transfer-scope"}}